          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Larger and faster defense aid shipments increase near‑term fuel consumption for military logistics and generate spot purchases (including forward cover), tightening available commercial volumes and lifting local/global spot diesel prices." />
