          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sharp reduction in Middle East crude exports tightens global spare capacity and limits replacement options for cut Russian supplies, lowering the practical ability of Ukraine and its partners to absorb energy disruptions." />
