          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising attacks or threats to commercial shipping draw naval and intelligence assets toward the Middle East and create gaps in European-area deterrence, which adversaries can exploit to raise the tempo or scale of operations in Ukraine." />
