          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Spikes in bond‑market volatility force higher margining and haircuts for commodity traders and brokers, reducing hedging capacity and liquidity in physical/diesel futures markets and producing short‑term upward pressure and larger swings in diesel spot prices." />
